cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the associated paper and this repository."
title: "SO-RoadUAV: A Scene-Observation Diagnostic Benchmark for UAV Traffic-Monitoring Road Perception"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
type: dataset
license: "CC-BY-NC-4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/air-ground-traffic-lab/SO-RoadUAV"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/Mozzzy/SO-RoadUAV"
abstract: >-
  SO-RoadUAV (referred to as Benchmark-V3 in the source code) is a CARLA-first
  benchmark for road-region segmentation and target-corridor lane recovery from
  single-frame UAV RGB images. It publishes 18,624 images with CARLA-derived
  road masks and projected lane-marking polylines, together with the generation
  pipeline and an official scorer.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - CARLA
  - UAV
  - road segmentation
  - lane detection
